          "event_id": "lite_evt_00184",
          "explanation": "The patient confirmed understanding of red flags and the plan to seek ED care if they appeared.",
          "quote": "我就直接急诊不等了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00194",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged that the patient understood the key execution and escalation plan.",
          "quote": "急诊门槛也记清了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Before the final open question, the patient had demonstrated understanding of when to seek emergency care, how to execute the medication schedule, and that obstetrics/original hospital would own follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
